IMAPAccount lkcamp
Host imap.purelymail.com
Port 993
User vpeixoto@lkcamp.dev
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup mail lkcamp"
SSLType IMAPS

IMAPStore lkcamp-remote
Account lkcamp

MaildirStore lkcamp-local
Path /home/nuke/mail/lkcamp/
Inbox /home/nuke/mail/lkcamp/INBOX/
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel lkcamp-inbox
Far :lkcamp-remote:
Near :lkcamp-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 0
ExpireUnread no

Channel lkcamp-sent
Far :lkcamp-remote:"Sent"
Near :lkcamp-local:"sent"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Group lkcamp
Channel lkcamp-inbox
Channel lkcamp-sent


# IMAPStore vpeixoto@lkcamp.dev-remote
